[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "♪ Take us to the Dollhouse ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "♪ Little by little"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Let's live in the meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "-♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "-♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "-♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "-♪ What's the big surprise? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "♪ Let's shrink right down and go inside ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "And…"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "There."
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Oh, hi! I'm so glad you're here."
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "I was just putting the finishing touches"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "on my Dollhouse Castle."
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "And do you know"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "what's better than one castle?"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "Two castles! Check it out!"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "It's my Marshmallow Kingdom."
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "Or as I like to call it,"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "the Kingdom of Squish."
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "I made it"
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "text": "with crispy graham cracker doors,"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "text": "fluffy whipped cream towers - mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "text": "And of course,"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "text": "lots of colorful mini marshmallows."
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "text": "Even the trees are made of marshmallows."
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "text": "I think I'll add just one more"
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "text": "over here."
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "text": "Boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "text": "And maybe another over here."
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "text": "Boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "text": "And one here. Boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "text": "Even Pandy's got himself"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "text": "a little sweet treat."
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "text": "You know what that sound means."
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "text": "It's time for a Dollhouse Delivery."
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "text": "Come on. Let's go see what it is."
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "text": "I wonder what our Meow Meow Mailbox"
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "text": "has for us today."
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "text": "Let's see."
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "text": "Our Kitty Cat Surprise Box"
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "text": "looks like a dragon. Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "text": "Check out the spikes"
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "text": "and this cool dragon tail."
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "text": "Ooh! And its wings."
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "text": "Do you think"
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "text": "there's a dragon surprise in here?"
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "text": "Only one way to find out."
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "text": "It looks like some kind of royal scroll."
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "text": "It's an invitation"
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "text": "from Queen Kitty Fairy and King Catnip."
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "text": "Aww!"
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "text": "Who's this cute little guy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "text": "Let's see what it says."
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "text": "\"Hear ye, hear ye.\""
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "text": "\"You are invited to the Dollhouse Castle"
  },
  {
    "index": 73,
    "text": "to meet the new Baby Dragon.\""
  },
  {
    "index": 74,
    "text": "\"Today is the Royal Naming Ceremony.\""
  },
  {
    "index": 75,
    "text": "Whoa! How cool is that?"
  },
  {
    "index": 76,
    "text": "I wonder what his name is gonna be."
  },
  {
    "index": 77,
    "text": "Do you want to come"
  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "text": "into the Dollhouse Castle with us"
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "text": "and meet the Baby Dragon?"
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "text": "Huzzah! Let's do it."
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "text": "It's time to get tiny."
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "text": "♪ A pinch on my left"
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "text": "Pinch, pinch on my right ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 84,
    "text": "♪ Grab Pandy's hand and hold on tight! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 85,
    "text": "I'm over here. Come on in."
  },
  {
    "index": 86,
    "text": "Welcome to the Dollhouse Castle."
  },
  {
    "index": 87,
    "text": "Are you ready to meet the Baby Dragon?"
  },
  {
    "index": 88,
    "text": "Me too."
  },
  {
    "index": 89,
    "text": "How about you, Pandy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 90,
    "text": "Pandy? Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 91,
    "text": "Where is that silly kitty hiding"
  },
  {
    "index": 92,
    "text": "this time?"
  },
  {
    "index": 93,
    "text": "Royal hug attack!"
  },
  {
    "index": 94,
    "text": "Greetings, Sir Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 95,
    "text": "You do give"
  },
  {
    "index": 96,
    "text": "the most royal of hugs."
  },
  {
    "index": 97,
    "text": "Why, thank you."
  },
  {
    "index": 98,
    "text": "It's okay, Baby Dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 99,
    "text": "You can do it."
  },
  {
    "index": 100,
    "text": "-Loop around and we'll try another one."
  },
  {
    "index": 101,
    "text": "-Greetings, CatRat the Brave."
  },
  {
    "index": 102,
    "text": "Greetings, my fellow knights."
  },
  {
    "index": 103,
    "text": "Huzzah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 104,
    "text": "CatRat, we heard there was"
  },
  {
    "index": 105,
    "text": "a new Baby Dragon in the kingdom."
  },
  {
    "index": 106,
    "text": "You heard that right."
  },
  {
    "index": 107,
    "text": "And your ol' pal CatRat the Brave"
  },
  {
    "index": 108,
    "text": "has the two most important jobs."
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "text": "I've got to come up with"
  },
  {
    "index": 110,
    "text": "the perfect name for the little fella."
  },
  {
    "index": 111,
    "text": "And I've got to teach him"
  },
  {
    "index": 112,
    "text": "how to land on this spot."
  },
  {
    "index": 113,
    "text": "He's got to learn how to make"
  },
  {
    "index": 114,
    "text": "a perfect landing for the King and Queen"
  },
  {
    "index": 115,
    "text": "at his Royal Naming Ceremony."
  },
  {
    "index": 116,
    "text": "-Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 117,
    "text": "-Oh, look!"
  },
  {
    "index": 118,
    "text": "Here he comes now."
  },
  {
    "index": 119,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 120,
    "text": "Check out his cool sparkle trail."
  },
  {
    "index": 121,
    "text": "Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 122,
    "text": "Here I come, CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 123,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 124,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 125,
    "text": "Whoa! Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 126,
    "text": "Uh… CatRat,"
  },
  {
    "index": 127,
    "text": "he's flying a little out of control."
  },
  {
    "index": 128,
    "text": "Yeah, he's really been having trouble"
  },
  {
    "index": 129,
    "text": "with this landing stuff."
  },
  {
    "index": 130,
    "text": "Okay, Baby Dragon, here's your spot."
  },
  {
    "index": 131,
    "text": "Come to CatRat. You got this."
  },
  {
    "index": 132,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 133,
    "text": "Whoa! Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 134,
    "text": "That's right. Uh-huh. Uh-huh."
  },
  {
    "index": 135,
    "text": "Uh-oh! He's gonna miss the landing spot."
  },
  {
    "index": 136,
    "text": "Whoa! Whaa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 137,
    "text": "Oh, no. Duck!"
  },
  {
    "index": 138,
    "text": "Whaa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 139,
    "text": "Baby Dragon!"
  },
  {
    "index": 140,
    "text": "Are you hurt?"
  },
  {
    "index": 141,
    "text": "I'm okay!"
  },
  {
    "index": 142,
    "text": "Oh, phew! Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 143,
    "text": "Baby Dragon, these are my friends,"
  },
  {
    "index": 144,
    "text": "Gabby and Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 145,
    "text": "Hello."
  },
  {
    "index": 146,
    "text": "Hi, Baby Dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 147,
    "text": "We're so excited to meet you."
  },
  {
    "index": 148,
    "text": "We're glad you're okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 149,
    "text": "That was a rough landing."
  },
  {
    "index": 150,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "index": 151,
    "text": "Not to worry, little buddy."
  },
  {
    "index": 152,
    "text": "They put the CatRat"
  },
  {
    "index": 153,
    "text": "in charge of your training for a reason."
  },
  {
    "index": 154,
    "text": "I guarantee"
  },
  {
    "index": 155,
    "text": "we're gonna figure out this landing thing"
  },
  {
    "index": 156,
    "text": "in time for the Royal Naming Ceremony."
  },
  {
    "index": 157,
    "text": "Thanks, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 158,
    "text": "Why don't you do another loop around,"
  },
  {
    "index": 159,
    "text": "and we'll try it again?"
  },
  {
    "index": 160,
    "text": "Okay, I'll try."
  },
  {
    "index": 161,
    "text": "Speaking of the Naming Ceremony,"
  },
  {
    "index": 162,
    "text": "figured out what you're gonna name him?"
  },
  {
    "index": 163,
    "text": "-Not yet."
  },
  {
    "index": 164,
    "text": "-Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 165,
    "text": "Maybe I can help."
  },
  {
    "index": 166,
    "text": "Let's see."
  },
  {
    "index": 167,
    "text": "We can call him…"
  },
  {
    "index": 168,
    "text": "Baby Crash Dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 169,
    "text": "-He's definitely an excellent crasher."
  },
  {
    "index": 170,
    "text": "-Hmm! A little too good at crashing."
  },
  {
    "index": 171,
    "text": "-Now we gotta work on the landing."
  },
  {
    "index": 172,
    "text": "-Look!"
  },
  {
    "index": 173,
    "text": "Here he comes again."
  },
  {
    "index": 174,
    "text": "You got this, Baby Dragon!"
  },
  {
    "index": 175,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 176,
    "text": "Right here, buddy."
  },
  {
    "index": 177,
    "text": "Whaa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 178,
    "text": "-Come back!"
  },
  {
    "index": 179,
    "text": "-Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 180,
    "text": "Oh, no! He crash-landed"
  },
  {
    "index": 181,
    "text": "in the Kingdom of Squish!"
  },
  {
    "index": 182,
    "text": "I hope he's okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 183,
    "text": "Don't worry! I'm okay!"
  },
  {
    "index": 184,
    "text": "-We've got to help him!"
  },
  {
    "index": 185,
    "text": "-To the Kingdom of Squish!"
  },
  {
    "index": 186,
    "text": "We're coming, Baby Dragon!"
  },
  {
    "index": 187,
    "text": "Oh, no!"
  },
  {
    "index": 188,
    "text": "We've got to get over this river."
  },
  {
    "index": 189,
    "text": "-How are we going to do that?"
  },
  {
    "index": 190,
    "text": "-I don't know!"
  },
  {
    "index": 191,
    "text": "Hang on, everybody."
  },
  {
    "index": 192,
    "text": "We don't know"
  },
  {
    "index": 193,
    "text": "how to get over the river yet."
  },
  {
    "index": 194,
    "text": "But there's got to be a way."
  },
  {
    "index": 195,
    "text": "Oh…"
  },
  {
    "index": 196,
    "text": "If there was a bridge,"
  },
  {
    "index": 197,
    "text": "we could get to the other side."
  },
  {
    "index": 198,
    "text": "That would be great."
  },
  {
    "index": 199,
    "text": "But there's no bridge."
  },
  {
    "index": 200,
    "text": "We could make one."
  },
  {
    "index": 201,
    "text": "If we had something long and flat,"
  },
  {
    "index": 202,
    "text": "we could lay it across the river"
  },
  {
    "index": 203,
    "text": "and run right over it."
  },
  {
    "index": 204,
    "text": "That's a great idea, Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 205,
    "text": "Maybe there's something in my room"
  },
  {
    "index": 206,
    "text": "we can use for a bridge. Come on."
  },
  {
    "index": 207,
    "text": "Okay, we need something long and flat"
  },
  {
    "index": 208,
    "text": "to make a bridge."
  },
  {
    "index": 209,
    "text": "Do you see something long and flat?"
  },
  {
    "index": 210,
    "text": "The ruler!"
  },
  {
    "index": 211,
    "text": "Cat-tastic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 212,
    "text": "Whoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 213,
    "text": "Let's do this."
  },
  {
    "index": 214,
    "text": "Baby Dragon needs us."
  },
  {
    "index": 215,
    "text": "Onward!"
  },
  {
    "index": 216,
    "text": "Whoa! Great work, team!"
  },
  {
    "index": 217,
    "text": "Let's go save that Baby Dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 218,
    "text": "We made it."
  },
  {
    "index": 219,
    "text": "Now let's find Baby Dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 220,
    "text": "Tell me when you see him."
  },
  {
    "index": 221,
    "text": "Help! Up here!"
  },
  {
    "index": 222,
    "text": "Yikes! He's way up"
  },
  {
    "index": 223,
    "text": "at the top of the castle."
  },
  {
    "index": 224,
    "text": "And… …I'm stuck."
  },
  {
    "index": 225,
    "text": "Uh…"
  },
  {
    "index": 226,
    "text": "Well, how are we gonna get him un-stuck?"
  },
  {
    "index": 227,
    "text": "Somebody's got to go up there"
  },
  {
    "index": 228,
    "text": "and pull him out."
  },
  {
    "index": 229,
    "text": "Well, he's my responsibility,"
  },
  {
    "index": 230,
    "text": "so I will make the climb."
  },
  {
    "index": 231,
    "text": "Don't worry, Baby Dragon!"
  },
  {
    "index": 232,
    "text": "CatRatty's coming!"
  },
  {
    "index": 233,
    "text": "Ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 234,
    "text": "Check out those moves."
  },
  {
    "index": 235,
    "text": "They don't call him CatRat the Brave"
  },
  {
    "index": 236,
    "text": "for nothing."
  },
  {
    "index": 237,
    "text": "You've got this, CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 238,
    "text": "Phew!"
  },
  {
    "index": 239,
    "text": "CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 240,
    "text": "Don't worry, little buddy."
  },
  {
    "index": 241,
    "text": "CatRat the Brave is here to help."
  },
  {
    "index": 242,
    "text": "I think we can do this"
  },
  {
    "index": 243,
    "text": "if we work together."
  },
  {
    "index": 244,
    "text": "I'll pull and you wiggle."
  },
  {
    "index": 245,
    "text": "I'll try, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 246,
    "text": "Okay. On the count of three."
  },
  {
    "index": 247,
    "text": "One, two,"
  },
  {
    "index": 248,
    "text": "three!"
  },
  {
    "index": 249,
    "text": "Gotcha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 250,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 251,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 252,
    "text": "Phew!"
  },
  {
    "index": 253,
    "text": "Wahoo! You did it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 254,
    "text": "Let's hear it for CatRat the Brave."
  },
  {
    "index": 255,
    "text": "-Uh-oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 256,
    "text": "-Huh?"
  },
  {
    "index": 257,
    "text": "Whoopsie!"
  },
  {
    "index": 258,
    "text": "Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 259,
    "text": "Sticky, sticky, yum!"
  },
  {
    "index": 260,
    "text": "Hey, CatRat,"
  },
  {
    "index": 261,
    "text": "maybe you could name him Sticky."
  },
  {
    "index": 262,
    "text": "Sticky?"
  },
  {
    "index": 263,
    "text": "Hmm. Eh, let's keep working on it."
  },
  {
    "index": 264,
    "text": "CatRat, I think we need to figure out"
  },
  {
    "index": 265,
    "text": "why Baby Dragon is having"
  },
  {
    "index": 266,
    "text": "so much trouble landing."
  },
  {
    "index": 267,
    "text": "Yeah. Why didn't you land on the spot?"
  },
  {
    "index": 268,
    "text": "I didn't see it."
  },
  {
    "index": 269,
    "text": "You didn't see me, CatRat,"
  },
  {
    "index": 270,
    "text": "waving and pointing to the spot?"
  },
  {
    "index": 271,
    "text": "Nope. I didn't see it."
  },
  {
    "index": 272,
    "text": "Wait a minute."
  },
  {
    "index": 273,
    "text": "I think I might know what's going on here."
  },
  {
    "index": 274,
    "text": "Baby Dragon is having trouble seeing."
  },
  {
    "index": 275,
    "text": "He can't see the landing spot,"
  },
  {
    "index": 276,
    "text": "so he keeps missing it."
  },
  {
    "index": 277,
    "text": "Really? Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 278,
    "text": "Let's give this theory a test."
  },
  {
    "index": 279,
    "text": "Baby Dragon,"
  },
  {
    "index": 280,
    "text": "how many tails am I holding up?"
  },
  {
    "index": 281,
    "text": "Uh… Two!"
  },
  {
    "index": 282,
    "text": "Two?!"
  },
  {
    "index": 283,
    "text": "I think we need to"
  },
  {
    "index": 284,
    "text": "get your eyes checked, buddy."
  },
  {
    "index": 285,
    "text": "-My eyes?"
  },
  {
    "index": 286,
    "text": "-It's okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 287,
    "text": "You might just need some glasses"
  },
  {
    "index": 288,
    "text": "to help you see better."
  },
  {
    "index": 289,
    "text": "We can go see MerCat the Magical."
  },
  {
    "index": 290,
    "text": "She can give you a royal eye exam"
  },
  {
    "index": 291,
    "text": "to find out what kind of glasses you need."
  },
  {
    "index": 292,
    "text": "Exam? Uh-uh. That sounds scary."
  },
  {
    "index": 293,
    "text": "I'll be with you the whole time,"
  },
  {
    "index": 294,
    "text": "and I promise"
  },
  {
    "index": 295,
    "text": "the royal eye exam won't hurt a bit."
  },
  {
    "index": 296,
    "text": "-Will you give it a try?"
  },
  {
    "index": 297,
    "text": "-Okay, I'll try."
  },
  {
    "index": 298,
    "text": "Yay!"
  },
  {
    "index": 299,
    "text": "That's my Baby Dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 300,
    "text": "Always willing to give it a try."
  },
  {
    "index": 301,
    "text": "Try! Try!"
  },
  {
    "index": 302,
    "text": "To MerCat the Magical!"
  },
  {
    "index": 303,
    "text": "MerCat the Magical."
  },
  {
    "index": 304,
    "text": "A visit from three brave knights"
  },
  {
    "index": 305,
    "text": "and Baby Dragon?"
  },
  {
    "index": 306,
    "text": "Shimmering sea scales!"
  },
  {
    "index": 307,
    "text": "I'm honored."
  },
  {
    "index": 308,
    "text": "We need your help."
  },
  {
    "index": 309,
    "text": "This Baby Dragon needs a royal eye test"
  },
  {
    "index": 310,
    "text": "to see if he needs glasses."
  },
  {
    "index": 311,
    "text": "And we gotta hurry,"
  },
  {
    "index": 312,
    "text": "because his Royal Naming Ceremony"
  },
  {
    "index": 313,
    "text": "is starting soon."
  },
  {
    "index": 314,
    "text": "Poppin' penguins! I'm on it."
  },
  {
    "index": 315,
    "text": "Hop right up into my royal eye exam chair,"
  },
  {
    "index": 316,
    "text": "Baby Dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 317,
    "text": "Now, put your eyes"
  },
  {
    "index": 318,
    "text": "right up to the royal machine"
  },
  {
    "index": 319,
    "text": "so I can test your eyes."
  },
  {
    "index": 320,
    "text": "Uh…"
  },
  {
    "index": 321,
    "text": "I think he's a little nervous"
  },
  {
    "index": 322,
    "text": "about the royal machine."
  },
  {
    "index": 323,
    "text": "It's okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 324,
    "text": "CatRat's right here."
  },
  {
    "index": 325,
    "text": "Psst!"
  },
  {
    "index": 326,
    "text": "Will you look with Baby Dragon?"
  },
  {
    "index": 327,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "index": 328,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 329,
    "text": "I'll show you a picture in the machine,"
  },
  {
    "index": 330,
    "text": "and you tell me if it's blurry or clear."
  },
  {
    "index": 331,
    "text": "-Ready?"
  },
  {
    "index": 332,
    "text": "-Ready."
  },
  {
    "index": 333,
    "text": "Here we go!"
  },
  {
    "index": 334,
    "text": "-See something?"
  },
  {
    "index": 335,
    "text": "-Uh-huh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 336,
    "text": "Is it blurry or clear?"
  },
  {
    "index": 337,
    "text": "Blurry."
  },
  {
    "index": 338,
    "text": "Okay. How about now?"
  },
  {
    "index": 339,
    "text": "Is it blurry or clear?"
  },
  {
    "index": 340,
    "text": "A little blurry."
  },
  {
    "index": 341,
    "text": "Is it blurry or clear?"
  },
  {
    "index": 342,
    "text": "Clear! And it's a crown!"
  },
  {
    "index": 343,
    "text": "A sparkly crown."
  },
  {
    "index": 344,
    "text": "Sparkle, sparkle, just like me!"
  },
  {
    "index": 345,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 346,
    "text": "That Baby Dragon"
  },
  {
    "index": 347,
    "text": "sure does love sparkles."
  },
  {
    "index": 348,
    "text": "I'm so proud of you, little buddy."
  },
  {
    "index": 349,
    "text": "You're always willing"
  },
  {
    "index": 350,
    "text": "to give things a try,"
  },
  {
    "index": 351,
    "text": "even when you're a little nervous."
  },
  {
    "index": 352,
    "text": "Gotta try."
  },
  {
    "index": 353,
    "text": "Well, MerCat the Magical,"
  },
  {
    "index": 354,
    "text": "what do you think?"
  },
  {
    "index": 355,
    "text": "He's definitely gonna see a lot better"
  },
  {
    "index": 356,
    "text": "with some glasses."
  },
  {
    "index": 357,
    "text": "Take this to Baby Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 358,
    "text": "She'll know"
  },
  {
    "index": 359,
    "text": "which glasses to give him."
  },
  {
    "index": 360,
    "text": "Thanks for your help, MerCat the Magical."
  },
  {
    "index": 361,
    "text": "It was my pleasure."
  },
  {
    "index": 362,
    "text": "To the craft room!"
  },
  {
    "index": 363,
    "text": "Buh-bye, MerCat."
  },
  {
    "index": 364,
    "text": "Bye! Good luck!"
  },
  {
    "index": 365,
    "text": "Boop! Boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 366,
    "text": "Boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 367,
    "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 368,
    "text": "Now, this is the perfect look"
  },
  {
    "index": 369,
    "text": "for the Royal Naming Ceremony."
  },
  {
    "index": 370,
    "text": "Baby Box,"
  },
  {
    "index": 371,
    "text": "you're just the cat we're looking for."
  },
  {
    "index": 372,
    "text": "Oh! Hello, everyone,"
  },
  {
    "index": 373,
    "text": "and adorable Baby Dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 374,
    "text": "What's going on?"
  },
  {
    "index": 375,
    "text": "Baby Dragon here"
  },
  {
    "index": 376,
    "text": "needs his very first pair of glasses."
  },
  {
    "index": 377,
    "text": "MerCat said to give this to you."
  },
  {
    "index": 378,
    "text": "You've come to the right place."
  },
  {
    "index": 379,
    "text": "I'd love to help."
  },
  {
    "index": 380,
    "text": "Aha! These glasses should do the trick."
  },
  {
    "index": 381,
    "text": "Try these on, Baby Dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 382,
    "text": "What if it won't work?"
  },
  {
    "index": 383,
    "text": "Well, you won't know until you try."
  },
  {
    "index": 384,
    "text": "But…"
  },
  {
    "index": 385,
    "text": "But nobody else wears glasses."
  },
  {
    "index": 386,
    "text": "Hey… What if we all wear glasses, huh?"
  },
  {
    "index": 387,
    "text": "-Great idea, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 388,
    "text": "-We could try them on together."
  },
  {
    "index": 389,
    "text": "Yay! Yay!"
  },
  {
    "index": 390,
    "text": "Even if you don't need glasses"
  },
  {
    "index": 391,
    "text": "to see better,"
  },
  {
    "index": 392,
    "text": "you can still wear them just for fun."
  },
  {
    "index": 393,
    "text": "Yeah. Glasses are paw-esome."
  },
  {
    "index": 394,
    "text": "Hang on, everybody."
  },
  {
    "index": 395,
    "text": "Here. These are my just-for-fun glasses."
  },
  {
    "index": 396,
    "text": "Ooh! Love the decorations."
  },
  {
    "index": 397,
    "text": "I want to decorate my glasses."
  },
  {
    "index": 398,
    "text": "Not a problem."
  },
  {
    "index": 399,
    "text": "Check it out."
  },
  {
    "index": 400,
    "text": "I've got all kinds of doodles and doodads"
  },
  {
    "index": 401,
    "text": "you can use on your glasses."
  },
  {
    "index": 402,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 403,
    "text": "Let's get crafting."
  },
  {
    "index": 404,
    "text": "How do you want to decorate your glasses,"
  },
  {
    "index": 405,
    "text": "Baby Dragon?"
  },
  {
    "index": 406,
    "text": "With stripes, just like me."
  },
  {
    "index": 407,
    "text": "Stripe away!"
  },
  {
    "index": 408,
    "text": "Stripes!"
  },
  {
    "index": 409,
    "text": "What next?"
  },
  {
    "index": 410,
    "text": "Sparkles!"
  },
  {
    "index": 411,
    "text": "Oh, yeah! Now we're talking."
  },
  {
    "index": 412,
    "text": "Watch this!"
  },
  {
    "index": 413,
    "text": "Paw-esome!"
  },
  {
    "index": 414,
    "text": "You really do love sparkles."
  },
  {
    "index": 415,
    "text": "I do! I do!"
  },
  {
    "index": 416,
    "text": "What else do you want on your glasses?"
  },
  {
    "index": 417,
    "text": "More spark lies!"
  },
  {
    "index": 418,
    "text": "More spark lies, huh?"
  },
  {
    "index": 419,
    "text": "Which of the things are the most sparkly?"
  },
  {
    "index": 420,
    "text": "Ooh! Sparkly gems!"
  },
  {
    "index": 421,
    "text": "Let's glue 'em on."
  },
  {
    "index": 422,
    "text": "Boop! Boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 423,
    "text": "Boop! Boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 424,
    "text": "-Boop! Boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 425,
    "text": "-Boop! Boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 426,
    "text": "Boopity-boop-boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 427,
    "text": "Boopity-boop-boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 428,
    "text": "And for the finishing touch,"
  },
  {
    "index": 429,
    "text": "some curly pipe cleaners."
  },
  {
    "index": 430,
    "text": "Here and here."
  },
  {
    "index": 431,
    "text": "Yay!"
  },
  {
    "index": 432,
    "text": "Pipe-cleaner-tastic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 433,
    "text": "Hmm. What do you think, buddy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 434,
    "text": "Are you ready to try 'em on?"
  },
  {
    "index": 435,
    "text": "Try! Try!"
  },
  {
    "index": 436,
    "text": "Tell us what you think."
  },
  {
    "index": 437,
    "text": "Well, little buddy, how are they?"
  },
  {
    "index": 438,
    "text": "I see! I see!"
  },
  {
    "index": 439,
    "text": "I see you"
  },
  {
    "index": 440,
    "text": "and you."
  },
  {
    "index": 441,
    "text": "And I see CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 442,
    "text": "Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 443,
    "text": "Now that you can see,"
  },
  {
    "index": 444,
    "text": "you'll stick the landing"
  },
  {
    "index": 445,
    "text": "at the Naming Ceremony, no problem."
  },
  {
    "index": 446,
    "text": "Thanks, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 447,
    "text": "The Royal Naming Ceremony's"
  },
  {
    "index": 448,
    "text": "about to begin."
  },
  {
    "index": 449,
    "text": "Oh, no! CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 450,
    "text": "You still don't have his royal name!"
  },
  {
    "index": 451,
    "text": "Let's see. How about Fred?"
  },
  {
    "index": 452,
    "text": "Or Purply? Or Freddy Purply!"
  },
  {
    "index": 453,
    "text": "Actually, Pandy, my boy,"
  },
  {
    "index": 454,
    "text": "I've already figured out"
  },
  {
    "index": 455,
    "text": "the purr-fect royal name for this guy."
  },
  {
    "index": 456,
    "text": "What do you think of…"
  },
  {
    "index": 457,
    "text": "Yippie!"
  },
  {
    "index": 458,
    "text": "-What is it? What is it?"
  },
  {
    "index": 459,
    "text": "-Uh-duh-duh-duh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 460,
    "text": "You're gonna have to wait"
  },
  {
    "index": 461,
    "text": "until the Royal Naming Ceremony."
  },
  {
    "index": 462,
    "text": "But trust me,"
  },
  {
    "index": 463,
    "text": "you're gonna love it."
  },
  {
    "index": 464,
    "text": "-Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 465,
    "text": "-We'll meet you up there."
  },
  {
    "index": 466,
    "text": "You got this!"
  },
  {
    "index": 467,
    "text": "I sure hope he can do it."
  },
  {
    "index": 468,
    "text": "What are we waiting for?"
  },
  {
    "index": 469,
    "text": "Let's get up to the Fairy Tail Garden"
  },
  {
    "index": 470,
    "text": "and cheer him on."
  },
  {
    "index": 471,
    "text": "For Baby Dragon!"
  },
  {
    "index": 472,
    "text": "Huzzah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 473,
    "text": "Oh! I'm so excited!"
  },
  {
    "index": 474,
    "text": "CatRat the Brave, please come forward."
  },
  {
    "index": 475,
    "text": "Have you chosen a name for your dragon?"
  },
  {
    "index": 476,
    "text": "Sure have, King Catnip. And it's a goodie."
  },
  {
    "index": 477,
    "text": "Now we just need the honorary Baby Dragon"
  },
  {
    "index": 478,
    "text": "to land on this spot before us."
  },
  {
    "index": 479,
    "text": "Yep, that's the plan."
  },
  {
    "index": 480,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 481,
    "text": "Oh! Look! Here he comes!"
  },
  {
    "index": 482,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 483,
    "text": "Look how he sparkles in the sky!"
  },
  {
    "index": 484,
    "text": "Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 485,
    "text": "Okay, time for that landing."
  },
  {
    "index": 486,
    "text": "Oh, boy! Oh, boy! Is he gonna make it?"
  },
  {
    "index": 487,
    "text": "Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 488,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 489,
    "text": "Here I come!"
  },
  {
    "index": 490,
    "text": "Yippie!"
  },
  {
    "index": 491,
    "text": "-Whoo! Bravo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 492,
    "text": "-Yay!"
  },
  {
    "index": 493,
    "text": "-Nice!"
  },
  {
    "index": 494,
    "text": "-Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 495,
    "text": "A very royal landing, young dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 496,
    "text": "Are you ready for your royal name?"
  },
  {
    "index": 497,
    "text": "Yeah! Yeah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 498,
    "text": "We hereby dub thee"
  },
  {
    "index": 499,
    "text": "Sparkle the Try-tastic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 500,
    "text": "I'm Try-tastic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 501,
    "text": "You sure are."
  },
  {
    "index": 502,
    "text": "I'm so proud."
  },
  {
    "index": 503,
    "text": "Thank you, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 504,
    "text": "I love my new name and my new glasses."
  },
  {
    "index": 505,
    "text": "Hey, want to go for a ride"
  },
  {
    "index": 506,
    "text": "with me, CatRat?"
  },
  {
    "index": 507,
    "text": "You know what? I'll try."
  },
  {
    "index": 508,
    "text": "You see that?"
  },
  {
    "index": 509,
    "text": "I'm learning from you."
  },
  {
    "index": 510,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 511,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 512,
    "text": "Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 513,
    "text": "-Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 514,
    "text": "-Look at them go!"
  },
  {
    "index": 515,
    "text": "CatRat's loving it."
  },
  {
    "index": 516,
    "text": "Sparkle the Try-tastic's got the moves."
  },
  {
    "index": 517,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 518,
    "text": "Wow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 519,
    "text": "That was quite the royal adventure."
  },
  {
    "index": 520,
    "text": "And thanks to your help,"
  },
  {
    "index": 521,
    "text": "Sparkle the Try-tastic is flying high."
  },
  {
    "index": 522,
    "text": "Are you ready for one more surprise?"
  },
  {
    "index": 523,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 524,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 525,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 526,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 527,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat"
  },
  {
    "index": 528,
    "text": "Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 529,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat of the Day! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 530,
    "text": "It's me, Baby Box!"
  },
  {
    "index": 531,
    "text": "Today, we're going to make"
  },
  {
    "index": 532,
    "text": "our very own fire-breathing dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 533,
    "text": "Wow! Can I try to make one too?"
  },
  {
    "index": 534,
    "text": "Of course you can make one,"
  },
  {
    "index": 535,
    "text": "Sparkle the Try-tastic."
  },
  {
    "index": 536,
    "text": "You're my dragon expert."
  },
  {
    "index": 537,
    "text": "For this craft,"
  },
  {
    "index": 538,
    "text": "you need a toilet paper roll,"
  },
  {
    "index": 539,
    "text": "pom-poms,"
  },
  {
    "index": 540,
    "text": "tissue paper strips,"
  },
  {
    "index": 541,
    "text": "your handy-dandy glue stick,"
  },
  {
    "index": 542,
    "text": "googly eyes,"
  },
  {
    "index": 543,
    "text": "and glittery paint."
  },
  {
    "index": 544,
    "text": "Ooh! Sparkly!"
  },
  {
    "index": 545,
    "text": "Just like you."
  },
  {
    "index": 546,
    "text": "Now, take the toilet paper roll"
  },
  {
    "index": 547,
    "text": "and paint it with the glitter paint."
  },
  {
    "index": 548,
    "text": "I'm painting too."
  },
  {
    "index": 549,
    "text": "Crafty-riffic painting!"
  },
  {
    "index": 550,
    "text": "Now we'll each need two pom-poms"
  },
  {
    "index": 551,
    "text": "and two googly eyes."
  },
  {
    "index": 552,
    "text": "Glue the pom-poms on first."
  },
  {
    "index": 553,
    "text": "Boop! Boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 554,
    "text": "Boop! Boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 555,
    "text": "And now the googly eyes."
  },
  {
    "index": 556,
    "text": "Boop! Boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 557,
    "text": "Boop! Boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 558,
    "text": "Two tiny pom-poms"
  },
  {
    "index": 559,
    "text": "for the nostrils."
  },
  {
    "index": 560,
    "text": "Snort-snort!"
  },
  {
    "index": 561,
    "text": "Snorty-snort-snort-snort!"
  },
  {
    "index": 562,
    "text": "Now get your tissue paper strips"
  },
  {
    "index": 563,
    "text": "and glue them to the inside of the roll."
  },
  {
    "index": 564,
    "text": "Like this."
  },
  {
    "index": 565,
    "text": "There's our dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 566,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 567,
    "text": "And let's not forget the finishing touch."
  },
  {
    "index": 568,
    "text": "-Glasses! Just like me!"
  },
  {
    "index": 569,
    "text": "-Yeah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 570,
    "text": "Now watch this."
  },
  {
    "index": 571,
    "text": "-Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 572,
    "text": "-Right?"
  },
  {
    "index": 573,
    "text": "A fire-breathing dragon!"
  },
  {
    "index": 574,
    "text": "I'm gonna try now."
  },
  {
    "index": 575,
    "text": "Ooh! Sparkle-riffic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 576,
    "text": "Sparkle, sparkle!"
  },
  {
    "index": 577,
    "text": "Thanks for building the dragon with us."
  },
  {
    "index": 578,
    "text": "Bye!"
  },
  {
    "index": 579,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 580,
    "text": "Hey, Dragon,"
  },
  {
    "index": 581,
    "text": "do you mind toasting this for me?"
  },
  {
    "index": 582,
    "text": "Ooh! Toasty!"
  },
  {
    "index": 583,
    "text": "Mmm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 584,
    "text": "I love having a dragon around."
  },
  {
    "index": 585,
    "text": "Thanks so much for coming"
  },
  {
    "index": 586,
    "text": "on our Dollhouse Castle adventure today."
  },
  {
    "index": 587,
    "text": "We couldn't have done it without you."
  },
  {
    "index": 588,
    "text": "See you next time."
  }
